{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791880680, "covers_from": "2026-10-13T08:38:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-13T08:39:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791880740, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-13T08:38:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 4302, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "交通", "content": "後山埤一帶到松山車站明明沒有很遠，但幾乎沒有公車營運，有也是班次很少，很不合理", "display_name": "南港代表 e", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T08:38:12+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 61812, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "交通", "content": "承德橋引道坡度很高陡峭，根本無法牽ubike過橋。行人下橋後的路段，沒有紅綠燈，無法過馬路非常危險", "display_name": "大同代表 No.61,812", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T08:38:27+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 60706, "sprite_key": "elephant_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "治安", "content": "車掃請穿防彈衣喔。", "display_name": "士林代表 No.60,706", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T08:38:32+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 51897, "sprite_key": "bear_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "公司派遣人員排班時數很沒有保障，是否該年年確認法條與時更進的合約內容符合勞基法的規範？", "display_name": "中山代表 No.51,897", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T08:38:46+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 21024, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "人行道上的自行車道彎彎曲曲的，又很容易有行人走在上面，蠻容易發生行人與自行車意外的", "display_name": "松山代表 No.21,024", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 61812, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.61,812", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 60706, "sprite_key": "elephant_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.60,706", "district": "shilin", "is_repla